  "body": "This change moves these four document types over to be \"standards mode\" documents.\n\nTo implement this, a new Document flag called \"parser cannot change the mode\" is added to the Document. This flag is checked before the parser tries to change the mode. If the flag is true, no change will be made.\n\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * Chromium (https://crbug.com/1131185)\n   * Mozilla (agreement at [spec triage meeting](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/6664#issuecomment-855151234))\n- [ ] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * A test exists for [plain text](https://wpt.fyi/results/html/browsers/browsing-the-web/read-text/load-text-plain.html?label=master&label=experimental&aligned), which I will update.\n   * I will try to write some tests for media documents. Plugin might be difficult, as will ua-inline.\n- [ ] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Chrome: https://crbug.com/1131185\n   * Firefox: …\n   * Safari: …\n\nCloses https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5939, Closes https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/3113\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6745/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 23, 2021, 5:26 PM UTC (186b195)\">/browsing-the-web.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6745/0e2bdcf...186b195/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 23, 2021, 5:26 PM UTC (186b195)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6745/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 23, 2021, 5:26 PM UTC (186b195)\">/parsing.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6745/0e2bdcf...186b195/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 23, 2021, 5:26 PM UTC (186b195)\">diff</a> )",
